    "Description": "WebKitGTK is the port of the portable web rendering engine WebKit to the GTK platform.\n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\n* chromium-browser: skia: Out of bounds read in Skia (CVE-2026-121084)\n\n* chromium-browser: angle: Use after free in ANGLE (CVE-2026-121148)\n\n* chromium-browser: angle: Out of bounds read in ANGLE (CVE-2026-121197)\n\n* chromium-browser: angle: Buffer overflow in ANGLE (CVE-2026-121249)\n\n* chromium-browser: skia: Buffer overflow in Skia (CVE-2026-121086)\n\n* chromium-browser: skia: Out of bounds read in Skia (CVE-2026-121160)\n\n* chromium-browser: skia: Uninitialized resource in Skia (CVE-2026-121072)\n\n* chromium-browser: skia: Uninitialized resource in Skia (CVE-2026-121227)\n\n* chromium-browser: skia: Out of bounds read in Skia (CVE-2026-121032)\n\n* chromium-browser: angle: Race condition in ANGLE (CVE-2026-121230)\n\nBug Fix(es) and Enhancement(s):\n\n* WebKitWebProcess crashes (SIGABRT) with webkit2gtk3 2.54.1 - Cisco Secure Client login window blank (JIRA:RHEL-290869)\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.",
